greyscale_bars.pgm: 640 x 480 pixels, quarters of 8, 16, 32 and 64 bars
    8 bars of 80 pixels: greys 0, 36, 73, ..., 255
    16 bars of 40 pixels: greys 255, 238, 221, ..., 0
    32 bars of 20 pixels: greys 0, 8, 16, ..., 255
    64 bars of 10 pixels: greys 255, 251, 247, ..., 0
